            "review_title": "Review at Bonjour Resto' Hai Ba Trung",
            "review_text": "russydy\nSingapore, Singapore28 contributions\n0\nFood average, efficent staff, old place\nDec 2017 • Business\nVisited this restaurant yesterday for lunch with my local office team.\nWe sat on the second floor. The carpet on the staircase was very old. Need to do something about this urgently.\nI ordered the duck with mashed potato. Food quality was average. Portion just nice.\nCredit to the efficient staff who served us. He was very attentive.\nOn our way down after our meal, we can see some rats' dropping on the ceiling structure. Right there in front of our eyes! Very unsightly! They need to clean these up immediately. \nOtherwise this is quite a cozy little eating place located in an interesting old alley.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 13, 2017",
