            "review_text": "bboykingtrack\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam47 contributions\n0\nAffordable french cuisine\nJun 2016 • Couples\nThe restaurant is on a small alley near Saigon Square. The decoration is very simple, don't expect too much. The staffs were fast but could be better. The price isn't considered as cheap in Vietnam but still cheaper than a lot of French restaurant in Saigon. Their beefsteak was good, however the quality may vary by time. I visit there 4 times and the taste changed between day and night, so I guess they have 2 cooks. My recommendation is you should visit at night based on my own experience.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 29, 2016",
